                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    652.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    652.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "But many people, out of ignorance or enthusiasm, try to recycle things that aren't actually recyclable: plastic bags, paper coffee cups, Styrofoam, greasy pizza boxes, and more. condition So what? Such \"aspirational recycling\" has major environmental consequences. By making waste collected for recycling more difficult or even impossible to process, it can result in whole loads of waste intended for recycling going to the landfill instead. cost of the condition",
            "block_bbox": [
                112,
                664,
                743,
                815
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
